* [#4379](https://github.com/ckeditor/ckeditor4/issues/4379): [Edge] Fixed: Incorrect detection of the [high contrast mode](https://ckeditor.com/docs/ckeditor4/latest/guide/dev_a11y.html#high-contrast-mode).
